<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='UTF-8'><title>试题导出</title><style>body{font-family:SimSun;margin:20px;}.question{margin-bottom:30px;page-break-after:avoid;}.question-title{font-weight:bold;font-size:14pt;margin-bottom:10px;}.question-content{margin-left:20px;margin-bottom:10px;}.choice{margin-left:30px;}.answer{margin-left:30px;color:#0066cc;}.analysis{margin-left:20px;color:#666;margin-top:10px;}</style></head><body><div class='question'><div class='question-title'>1. 单选题 (未知)</div><div class='question-content'>Java中，以下哪个关键字用于定义常量？</div><div class='choice'>A. static</div><div class='choice'>B. final <span style='color:red'>(正确答案)</span></div><div class='choice'>C. const <span style='color:red'>(正确答案)</span></div><div class='choice'>D. define</div><div class='analysis'><strong>试题解析：</strong><br>final关键字用于定义常量，一旦赋值不能修改</div></div><hr><div class='question'><div class='question-title'>2. 单选题 (简单)</div><div class='question-content'>以下哪个不是Java的基本数据类型？</div><div class='choice'>A. int</div><div class='choice'>B. double</div><div class='choice'>C. String <span style='color:red'>(正确答案)</span></div><div class='choice'>D. boolean</div><div class='analysis'><strong>试题解析：</strong><br>String是引用类型，不是基本数据类型</div></div><hr><div class='question'><div class='question-title'>3. 填空题 (简单)</div><div class='question-content'>大大大</div><div class='answer'><strong>参考答案：</strong><br>填空1：dad<br></div><div class='analysis'><strong>试题解析：</strong><br>k</div></div><hr></body></html>